  "title": "Nature-Based Solutions in schools: a green way to adapt buildings to climate change in Solana de los Barros, Extremadura (Spain)",
  "summary": "Different types of green roofs, green facades, permeable paving and ventilation systems have been tested in a school building of Spain to address increasing temperatures and water scarcity. The implementation of a detailed monitoring scheme revealed positive results indicating high replication potential and possible incorporation of nature-based solutions in the national building code . In a school located in Solana de los Barros (Badajoz, Extremadura, Spain) several nature-based solutions (NbS) have been designed and implemented to minimise climate impacts, as part of the EU LIFE project myBUILDINGisGREEN LIFE .",
